# License

This pack carries the slug `srd-5.2` and is intended to track the WotC
**System Reference Document 5.2.1** (April 2025 release), licensed under
[Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY 4.0)](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode).

## Required attribution

Operators redistributing this content must surface the following notice
where the content is displayed:

> Portions of this content are from the System Reference Document 5.2.1
