> of the Coast endorsement is not implied.

## Provenance notes

The numeric / categorical fields on each spell row (`level`, `school`,
`castingTime`, `range`, `components`, `duration`, `concentration`,
`ritual`, `classes`) are factual game-rule data. Mechanical fields
(`activities[]`, `upcastScaling`, etc.) are original engine-shape
expressions of the same facts.

**Spell descriptions (`data.description`)** — when present — are brief
original paraphrases authored for this pack. Verbatim prose from any
licensed source is not included. Phase-1 slug-stub rows ship without a
`description` field; Phase-2 hand-authored rows carry short summaries
covering only the mechanical effect.

## Cross-reference: SRD 5.1 (OGL 1.0a)

A locally available SRD 5.1 prose-as-JSON dump
(`~/workspace/dnd-5e-srd`) was used as a structural reference during
bulk import — solely for spell *names* and the canonical metadata table
(level / school / casting time / range / components / duration). These
are facts, not protected expression. No description prose was copied
verbatim.

If this pack is ever reauthored to include verbatim SRD 5.1 prose, it
must be relabeled `srd-5.1` and ship the full OGL 1.0a notice + Section
15 attribution per the [seed-sources.md](../../docs/seed-sources.md)
guidance.
